  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2cf3496069245fb0",
      "translationZh": "介绍 Gemini 3.8 Live 和 3.8 Live Extended Thinking",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "939daf817e9c7e19",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.8 Live 和 Gemini 3.8 Live Extended Thinking 是我们目前最先进的实时对话模型。智能和并行推理的重大升级使它们在协作和使用语音执行复杂任务时更加直观。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b2eb006abda5576c",
      "translationZh": "技术成员，代表 Gemini 音频团队",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a21b58ba4c2f878a",
      "translationZh": "您的浏览器不支持音频元素。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9396d34c840bf012",
      "translationZh": "此内容由 Google AI 生成。生成式 AI 处于实验阶段。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e0bfa231ca2481f0",
      "translationZh": "我们正在推出 Gemini 3.8 Live 和 Gemini 3.8 Live Extended Thinking，以使语音交互更加自然、流畅和智能。这些模型能够在不打断您对话的情况下处理复杂推理、实时视觉上下文以及后台任务执行。您可以今天通过 Gemini API、Google Workspace 和 Gemini 应用开始使用这些功能。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b43a10482221e5d",
      "translationZh": "摘要由 Google AI 生成。生成式 AI 处于实验阶段。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e5bed38d8408242e",
      "translationZh": "查看《介绍 Gemini 3.8 Live 和 3.8 Live Extended Thinking》以获取更智能的语音 AI。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "37d0dbe30efcf529",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.8 Live 提供快速、流畅的对话，具备实时视觉和语言支持。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ce24b631952767c0",
      "translationZh": "使用 3.8 Live Extended Thinking 处理复杂任务，同时保持对话流畅。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "37acd17c51d5d6bc",
      "translationZh": "这些模型在后台工作，管理工具，而您继续聊天。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d5255da13bfea54f",
      "translationZh": "您可以在 Google Workspace、Search 和 Gemini 应用中尝试这些新功能。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fb4c941c19c3737a",
      "translationZh": "Google 刚刚推出两款新的 AI 模型，让与设备的对话感觉更加自然。它们可以处理中断，在语言之间切换，甚至在工作时解释它们的思考过程。无论您是在解决复杂问题还是只是聊天，AI 现在感觉就像在真正倾听并与您同步思考。这使得 AI 感觉像真正的对话伙伴迈出了重要一步。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f344ef9188695765",
      "translationZh": "探索其他样式：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cf1dcdea5ec88618",
      "translationZh": "今天，我们推出两款新模型，它们在近实时推理方面取得进展，以更有效地启用语音代理，并让与 AI 的对话感觉更直观和智能。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1ce5df00b331c39d",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.8 Live：专为规模和成本效益而构建，结合了对话智能、流畅对话和视觉基础。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0897c1b53597174d",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.8 Live Extended Thinking：专为高复杂度任务而构建，具备更高的智能和多步推理能力。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "43f056e802157bfb",
      "translationZh": "对于开发者和企业，这些模型提供了构建可靠、生产就绪语音代理的基础。它们还能让您在 Gemini 应用、Google Workspace 和搜索中与 Gemini 的交流更加流畅和协作 — — 仅凭语音即可应对复杂任务。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ca8a76f34e443a87",
      "translationZh": "体验更流畅、智能的对话",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fa8c6c67e56ea80f",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.8 Live Extended Thinking 提供企业级任务完成和智能，在 Artificial Analysis' Speech to Speech Quality Index（82.6）中获得总体排名第一，并在 τ -Voice 上以 68.6% 的成绩领先于代理任务完成，在 Sierra’s τ -Voice-banking 基准上以 35.1% 领先。它还具备强大的推理能力，在 Big Bench Audio 上得分 97.7%，同时相比其他前沿模型保持具有竞争力的价格。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "99bea1c57829f759",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.8 Live 在用户中表现出高偏好，在 Speech Agent Arena 中获得第二名。除了这一表现，它仍然具有高性价比 — — 为开发者和企业提供了一款适用于规模化的强大且高效的模型。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "06d7368ad5a8272c",
      "translationZh": "在 ServiceNow 的 EVA-Bench 上 — — 这是评估语音代理的基准 — — 我们的模型通过在复杂工作流中成功平衡准确性与对话质量，推动了帕累托前沿。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d2e733a2dc9b9635",
      "translationZh": "注意：此测试在 Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform 的 Live API 上运行。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fd8a5482af7feb66",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.8 Live 能够在近实时处理视觉输入，利用上下文丰富对话以提供更有帮助的响应。它能够自动检测并在对话过程中在 97 种支持的语言之间切换。它在后台执行工具和 API 调用，同时继续对话，使模型能够确认请求并在后台任务完成时继续聊天。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a832d4d0153b2063",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.8 Live 实时引导员工入职，利用视觉上下文回答实时问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e2ec8f4316c5db48",
      "translationZh": "观看 Gemini 3.8 Live 在近乎实时的情况下下棋，利用视觉上下文、推理和自然的对话流程。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4f1559accbc14175",
      "translationZh": "对于需要更深层次推理的任务，3.8 Live Extended Thinking 同时进行推理和说话。它在保持不间断对话流程的同时，为复杂工作流提供更高的智能 — — 使用诸如 “让我检查一下…” 之类的早期语言提示自然地确认提示，并通过实时进度旁白引导用户完成多步骤后台任务的进展。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8c3db80ba7334ed9",
      "translationZh": "观看 Gemini 3.8 Live Extended Thinking 将原始草图和近乎实时的语音反馈转化为功能性的 React 组件。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2125fc7c2c4312a0",
      "translationZh": "观看 Gemini 3.8 Live Extended Thinking 协调多步骤预订和异步函数调用 — — 全程不中断自然的实时对话。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f8e03753a2ac002a",
      "translationZh": "观看 Gemini 3.8 Live 通过自然语音即时构建完整的商业计划和定制的营销工具包。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3667a214d236f163",
      "translationZh": "在 Google Workspace 和 Search 中，我们的 Live 模型提供更直观、协作的体验 — — 尤其是在处理您最复杂的任务时。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "174e4469571f854d",
      "translationZh": "在 Google Workspace 中尝试 Gemini 3.8 Live Extended Thinking，配合 Docs Live、Gmail Live 和 Keep Live。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "cfb86eb557abec07",
      "translationZh": "获取由 Gemini 3.8 Live 提供支持的逐步实时故障排除帮助 — — 直接在 Search Live 中。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4451c4cc9252fe5a",
      "translationZh": "赋能开发者和企业语音生态系统",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f77265aba99f86d5",
      "translationZh": "通过使用 Gemini Live API，Agora、Fishjam、LangChain、LiveKit、Pipecat、Vercel 和 Vision Agents 等开发者平台使开发者能够轻松构建和部署高性能语音驱动界面。这些平台在幕后管理复杂的实时媒体流基础设施，使开发者能够完全专注于打造用户体验。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6822f9734eaa9324",
      "translationZh": "我们还与 Salesforce、Genspark 和 Lumeris 等公司合作，这些公司对 3.8 Live 和 3.8 Live Extended Thinking 感到兴奋，突出其卓越的延迟、流畅性和工具调用能力。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "312de586c5833d56",
      "translationZh": "使用 SynthID 水印确保透明度",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a5da1832fb16ba51",
      "translationZh": "我们的 AI 产品生成的所有音频均嵌入 SynthID 水印。这种不可感知的水印直接编织到音频输出中，确保 AI 生成的内容可被检测，以帮助防止错误信息。有关我们安全与责任方法的详细信息，请查看模型卡。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "159486c37e07d5af",
      "translationZh": "开始使用我们最新的 Gemini Audio 模型：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3b5a3c9431687153",
      "translationZh": "3.8 Live 将从今天开始推出：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "036e319c1803ac28",
      "translationZh": "对于开发者：在 Gemini API 和 Google AI Studio 中",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d5c5f1add16d5571",
      "translationZh": "对于企业：在 Gemini Enterprise 的私有预览中，并即将推出 Gemini Enterprise for Customer Experience",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3d55902a257ac1fd",
      "translationZh": "对于所有人：在 Search Live 中",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "96d9e7764281b7e2",
      "translationZh": "3.8 Live Extended Thinking 今日起开始推出：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0eab758cb061c84a",
      "translationZh": "对于企业：在 Gemini Enterprise 的私有预览中，并即将推出 Gemini Enterprise for Customer Experience 和面向 Google Workspace 企业客户的产品",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cd5f37c0f928b0ec",
      "translationZh": "对于所有人：在 Gemini Live 中，以及面向 Workspace 中 Docs 的 Google AI Pro 和 Ultra 订阅者，以及所有在 Gmail 和 Keep 中的 Google AI 订阅者",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ba07e0e30582b629",
      "translationZh": "在您的收件箱中获取 Google 的最新新闻",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1c2f6429af68386",
      "translationZh": "完成。只需再进行一步。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "177af4ad1775d8ae",
      "translationZh": "请检查您的收件箱以确认您的订阅。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ff091e7a47df15e",
      "translationZh": "您也可以使用 . 进行订阅。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7aff2425f36a647a",
      "translationZh": "面向政府和企业的主动网络防御",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1dfb337a4798db76",
      "translationZh": "介绍 Gemini 3.8 Flash 和 3.8 Flash Cyber",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0c70e13af0df73cc",
      "translationZh": "作者：Tulsee Doshi & Raluca Ada Popa",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "892c6f3a5093583b",
      "translationZh": "我们在2026年8月宣布的最新AI新闻",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "91979947e61b341b",
      "translationZh": "由 Google 团队发布的新闻",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
